[00:20.06]1. When a man becomes a father
[00:24.86]And a woman has a child of her own,
[00:29.50]They share a trust, they must remember,
[00:34.46]That is not theirs, not theirs alone.
[00:39.42]The gift they share is from Jehovah;
[00:44.35]Of life and love he is the one true Source.
[00:47.82]To parents he gives sure direction
[00:51.29]That they may follow the wisest course.
[00:55.21](Chorus)
[00:59.13]A sacred trust you have been given;
[01:03.97]A precious life is in your hands.
[01:08.89]You can bestow the greatest favor;
[01:13.85]Instruct your child in God’s commands.
[01:26.88]2. All the words God has commanded—
[01:31.77]They must always prove to be on your heart.
[01:36.28]These words you’ll speak to sons and daughters;
[01:41.18]This is your trust, this is your part.
[01:46.18]To them you’ll speak along your roadway,
[01:51.18]When you rise up and when you are at rest.
[01:55.98]In years to come, may they remember,
[02:01.44]May they be faithful, may they be blessed.
[02:03.66](Chorus)
[02:05.88]A sacred trust you have been given;
[02:10.96]A precious life is in your hands.
[02:15.84]You can bestow the greatest favor;
[02:20.84]Instruct your child in God’s commands.